    <template id="cta" name="Start a conversation">
        <section class="cta-section">
            <div class="shell cta-inner"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT CHAPTER</p><h2>There’s a better<br/>way to <em>work.</em></h2></div><div class="cta-copy"><p>Tell us what’s slowing you down.<br/>We’ll explore what’s possible.</p><a class="button button-light" href="/contactus">Let’s make it happen <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div>
        </section>
    </template>

    <template id="home" name="Biztinct home">
        <t t-call="biztinct_website.layout">
            <section class="hero hero-v2 hero-text hero-stacked">
                <div class="hero-light" aria-hidden="true"></div>
                <div class="shell hero-stage">
                    <div class="hero-brand"><span class="brand-name">Biztinct</span></div>
                    <div class="hero-lower">
                        <div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span> BUSINESS SOFTWARE. DISTINCT BY DESIGN.</p><h1>Less friction.<br/>More <em>momentum.</em></h1></div>
                        <div class="hero-summary"><p class="hero-description">Your ambition deserves better tools.<br/>We build custom software and connect your systems,<br class="desktop-break"/> so your business can move as one.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/contactus">Let’s build your next chapter <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/solutions">Explore our solutions <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <a class="hero-scroll" href="#possibilities"><span></span> SCROLL TO EXPLORE</a>
            </section>
            <div class="capability-strip"><div class="shell"><span>BUILT AROUND YOUR BUSINESS</span><div><span>Custom development</span><i>✦</i><span>Workflow automation</span><i>✦</i><span>Connected operations</span><i>✦</i><span>Digital experiences</span></div></div></div>
            <section id="possibilities" class="section shell intro-section">
                <p class="eyebrow">LESS FRICTION. MORE POSSIBILITY.</p><div class="intro-grid"><h2>Good businesses<br/>deserve <em>better tools.</em></h2><div><p class="large-copy">The spreadsheet that’s doing too much. The same information entered three times. The system your team works around.</p><p>We turn those everyday frustrations into software that makes sense. Combining custom development with established business functionality, we help you move from disconnected tasks to one connected way of working.</p><a class="text-link" href="/approach">Meet the Biztinct approach <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div>
            </section>
            <section class="section solutions-section">
                <div class="shell"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">WHAT WE MAKE POSSIBLE</p><h2>A better fit.<br/><em>At every touchpoint.</em></h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/solutions">See all solutions <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
                    <div class="solution-grid">
                        <a href="/solutions#custom" class="solution-card card-custom"><div class="card-top"><span>01 / MADE FOR YOU</span><span class="circle-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><h3>Software that fits.<br/>Without the compromise.</h3><p>Purpose-built applications for the processes that make your business distinct.</p><span class="card-link">Custom development <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span></a>
                        <a href="/solutions#automation" class="solution-card card-automation"><div class="card-top"><span>02 / LESS MANUAL</span><span class="circle-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><h3>Let the work<br/>take care of itself.</h3><p>Turn repetitive tasks and handoffs into clear, connected workflows.</p><span class="card-link">Workflow automation <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span></a>
                        <a href="/solutions#operations" class="solution-card card-connected"><div class="card-top"><span>03 / IN SYNC</span><span class="circle-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><h3>One business.<br/>Everything connected.</h3><p>Bring sales, people, finance and operations into the same conversation.</p><span class="card-link">Business systems <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span></a>
                    </div>
                    <a class="digital-banner" href="/solutions#digital"><div class="digital-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</div><div><h3>And a digital front door that feels like you.</h3><p>Websites, e-commerce and online experiences, connected to your business.</p></div><span class="circle-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
                </div>
            </section>
            <section class="section shell philosophy-section"><div class="philosophy-copy"><p class="eyebrow">CUSTOM WHERE IT COUNTS</p><h2>Distinct needs.<br/><em>Smart foundations.</em></h2><p>You shouldn’t have to change the way you work just to fit your software. And you shouldn’t have to build every feature from scratch.</p><p>We combine the right existing functionality with the custom features you actually need. A considered way to build, with your business at the centre.</p><a class="text-link" href="/approach">How we bring it together <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
            <section class="section process-section"><div class="shell"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">A CLEAR PATH FORWARD</p><h2>From “there must be<br/>a better way” to <em>there is.</em></h2></div><p class="section-side-copy">We start with your work.<br/>Then make the technology fit.</p></div><div class="process-grid"><article><span class="step-number">01</span><h3>Understand</h3><p>Map your processes, listen to your team and find the friction worth fixing.</p></article><article><span class="step-number">02</span><h3>Shape</h3><p>Choose the right foundations and design the custom pieces around your needs.</p></article><article><span class="step-number">03</span><h3>Build</h3><p>Bring the solution to life, with your real workflows guiding the details.</p></article><article><span class="step-number">04</span><h3>Move forward</h3><p>Put it to work and refine the experience as your business evolves.</p></article></div></div></section>
            <section class="section shell industries-section"><p class="eyebrow">DIFFERENT BUSINESSES. SHARED POSSIBILITIES.</p><h2>Whatever your world,<br/>let’s make it <em>work better.</em></h2><div class="industry-tags"><span>Small &amp; medium businesses</span><span>Not-for-profits</span><span>Hospitality</span><span>Healthcare</span><span>Education</span><span>Transport &amp; fleet</span><span>Construction</span></div><p>Your industry gives us context. Your actual processes give us the brief.</p></section>
            <t t-call="biztinct_website.cta"/>
        </t>
    </template>

    <template id="solutions" name="Biztinct solutions">
        <t t-call="biztinct_website.layout">
            <section class="shell page-hero"><p class="eyebrow">SOLUTIONS / BUILT AROUND YOU</p><h1>Less working around.<br/>More <em>working together.</em></h1><div class="page-hero-bottom"><p>From a single workflow to a connected business system.<br/>We build the pieces that help your business move.</p><a class="button" href="/contactus">Find your better fit <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
            <div class="solution-index"><nav class="shell" aria-label="Explore solutions"><a href="#custom">Custom software</a><a href="#automation">Automation</a><a href="#operations">Business systems</a><a href="#digital">Digital experiences</a></nav></div>
            <section id="custom" class="section shell detail-section"><div class="detail-copy"><p class="eyebrow">01 / CUSTOM DEVELOPMENT</p><h2>Your way of working.<br/><em>Built into the software.</em></h2><p>Some processes are too important to squeeze into a standard template. We build custom applications and features around your requirements, so the technology supports what makes your business work.</p><ul class="feature-list"><li>Applications for your specific business processes</li><li>Custom forms, records and approval flows</li><li>Extensions to established business functionality</li><li>Tools for businesses and not-for-profit organisations</li></ul><a class="text-link" href="/contactus">Talk through your requirements <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="detail-visual custom-visual"><div class="visual-caption">YOUR BUSINESS IS THE BLUEPRINT</div><img class="detail-sculpture" src="/biztinct_website/static/src/img/custom-modules-v2.webp" width="768" height="768" alt="Interlocking glass and chrome modules illustrating a tailored software solution" loading="lazy"/><p>Custom where you need it.<br/>Established where it makes sense.</p></div></section>
            <section id="automation" class="section detail-tinted"><div class="shell detail-section"><div class="detail-visual automation-visual"><div class="visual-caption">AN EXAMPLE OF A SIMPLER HANDOFF</div><div class="workflow-stack"><span><b>01</b> Request received <i>✓</i></span><div></div><span><b>02</b> Routed for approval <i>✓</i></span><div></div><span><b>03</b> Next action triggered <i>↗</i></span></div><p>Illustrative workflow. Designed around your process.</p></div><div class="detail-copy"><p class="eyebrow">02 / WORKFLOW AUTOMATION</p><h2>Give busywork<br/><em>less of your day.</em></h2><p>Re-entering data, chasing updates and moving information between disconnected tools all take time. We help turn those manual steps into workflows your team can follow with confidence.</p><ul class="feature-list"><li>Repetitive tasks and process handoffs</li><li>Timesheets, expenses and employee workflows</li><li>Communication, events and surveys</li><li>Connected records and clearer visibility</li></ul><a class="text-link" href="/contactus">Show us what slows you down <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
            <section id="operations" class="section shell detail-section"><div class="detail-copy"><p class="eyebrow">03 / CONNECTED BUSINESS SYSTEMS</p><h2>All the moving parts.<br/><em>A shared direction.</em></h2><p>Bring the functions of your business closer together. Combine the modules you need with tailored features, so your team can work from connected information.</p><div class="system-list"><div id="sales"><h3>Sales &amp; customers</h3><p>CRM, quotations, sales, invoicing, point of sale and subscriptions.</p></div><div><h3>People &amp; projects</h3><p>HR, recruitment, attendance, leave, expenses, appraisals, projects and timesheets.</p></div><div><h3>Operations &amp; finance</h3><p>Accounting, inventory, purchasing, manufacturing and case management.</p></div></div><a class="text-link" href="/contactus">Connect the dots in your business <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><t t-call="biztinct_website.flow_art"/></section>
            <section id="digital" class="section detail-tinted"><div class="shell detail-section"><div class="detail-visual digital-visual"><div class="visual-caption">YOUR BUSINESS, BEYOND THE SCREEN</div><div class="browser-illustration"><div class="browser-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>your business</span></div><div class="browser-content"><span>WELCOME TO WHAT’S NEXT</span><strong>A distinct<br/><em>experience.</em></strong><div class="browser-button">Explore <span>↗</span></div><div class="browser-shape">✦</div></div></div><p>Illustrative design. A digital experience of your own.</p></div><div class="detail-copy"><p class="eyebrow">04 / WEBSITES &amp; E-COMMERCE</p><h2>A great first impression.<br/><em>A connected next step.</em></h2><p>Your website should do more than introduce your business. We create digital experiences that bring your online presence and business operations together.</p><ul class="feature-list"><li>Website design and development</li><li>E-commerce and online customer journeys</li><li>Blogs, forums and learning content</li><li>Integration with business modules</li></ul><a class="text-link" href="/contactus">Let’s shape your digital experience <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
            <section id="industries" class="section shell industries-section"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR INDUSTRY. YOUR INDIVIDUAL NEEDS.</p><h2>Built for the way<br/><em>your world works.</em></h2><p class="large-copy">Every industry has its patterns. Every organisation has its own way of doing things.</p><div class="industry-tags"><span>Small &amp; medium businesses</span><span>Not-for-profits</span><span>Restaurants &amp; cafés</span><span>Hotels</span><span>Clinics &amp; hospitals</span><span>Education &amp; coaching</span><span>Transport &amp; fleet</span><span>Building &amp; construction</span><span>Events</span></div><p>We start with your requirements to identify the right mix of custom and existing functionality.</p></section>
            <t t-call="biztinct_website.cta"/>
        </t>
    </template>

    <template id="approach" name="The Biztinct approach">
        <t t-call="biztinct_website.layout">
            <section class="shell page-hero"><p class="eyebrow">OUR APPROACH / DISTINCT BY DESIGN</p><h1>The right technology.<br/>The <em>human way.</em></h1><div class="page-hero-bottom"><p>We begin with the people and processes behind your business.<br/>Then shape the software around them.</p><a class="button" href="/contactus">Start a conversation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
            <section class="manifesto-section"><div class="shell manifesto-inner"><span class="eyebrow">THE BIZTINCT BELIEF</span><h2>Your business is distinct.<br/>Your software should<br/><em>understand that.</em></h2><p>Useful technology starts with a simple question:<br/>what would make your working day better?</p><img src="/biztinct_website/static/src/img/connected-systems-v2.webp" width="768" height="768" alt=""/></div></section>
            <section class="section shell approach-steps"><div class="approach-step"><span class="step-number">01</span><h2>First, we <em>listen.</em></h2><div><p>Your team knows where work gets stuck. We start by understanding your existing processes, the tools you use and the outcomes you need.</p><span class="step-outcome">A shared picture of the problem.</span></div></div><div class="approach-step"><span class="step-number">02</span><h2>Then, we <em>shape.</em></h2><div><p>We look at what established functionality can already do, and where your business needs something distinct. Together, we define the mix that makes sense.</p><span class="step-outcome">A solution grounded in your requirements.</span></div></div><div class="approach-step"><span class="step-number">03</span><h2>Next, we <em>build.</em></h2><div><p>We develop the custom pieces and connect the right business modules. Your real processes guide how the solution works, from everyday tasks to the bigger picture.</p><span class="step-outcome">Software designed around your work.</span></div></div><div class="approach-step"><span class="step-number">04</span><h2>Keep moving <em>forward.</em></h2><div><p>Putting software into use is where its value becomes clear. We work through the practical details and discuss what your team needs as your processes evolve.</p><span class="step-outcome">A considered path from build to use.</span></div></div></section>
            <section class="section principles-section"><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow">WHAT GUIDES THE WORK</p><h2>Thoughtful choices.<br/><em>Useful outcomes.</em></h2><div class="principles-grid"><article><span>✦</span><h3>Your process comes first.</h3><p>We design around your requirements, rather than asking you to work around unnecessary limitations.</p></article><article><span>↔</span><h3>Build on what works.</h3><p>Established functionality provides the foundations. Custom development adds the pieces that make the difference.</p></article><article><span>↗</span><h3>Make the everyday easier.</h3><p>Clear workflows and connected information matter more than a long list of features.</p></article></div></div></section>
            <t t-call="biztinct_website.cta"/>
        </t>
    </template>

    <template id="contact" name="Contact Biztinct">
        <t t-call="biztinct_website.layout">
            <section class="shell contact-section"><div class="contact-intro"><p class="eyebrow">LET’S TALK / WHAT’S NEXT?</p><h1>Big idea.<br/>Small frustration.<br/><em>Start here.</em></h1><p>You don’t need a finished brief.<br/>Just tell us what you’d like to work better.</p><a class="contact-email" href="mailto:ash@biztinct.com">ash@biztinct.com <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="contact-next"><p class="eyebrow">WHAT HAPPENS NEXT</p><div><span>01</span><p>We read your enquiry.</p></div><div><span>02</span><p>We get in touch to understand your needs.</p></div><div><span>03</span><p>We explore the right way forward.</p></div></div><div class="contact-decoration" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/biztinct_website/static/src/img/connected-systems-v2.webp" width="768" height="768" alt="" loading="lazy"/></div></div>
                <div class="contact-form-wrap"><div class="form-heading"><h2>Tell us a little<br/>about <em>your business.</em></h2><p>Fields marked * are required.</p></div>
                    <form action="/contactus" method="post" class="contact-form">
                        <input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" t-att-value="request.csrf_token()"/>
                        <div t-if="errors" class="form-error-summary" role="alert" tabindex="-1"><strong>Please check your enquiry.</strong><p t-if="errors.get('general')" t-esc="errors['general']"/><p t-else="">Review the highlighted fields below and try again.</p></div>
                        <div class="form-row"><div class="form-field"><label for="contact-name">Your name *</label><input id="contact-name" name="name" type="text" required="required" maxlength="120" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Alex Taylor" t-att-value="form.get('name', '')" t-att-aria-invalid="'true' if errors.get('name') else None" t-att-aria-describedby="'name-error' if errors.get('name') else None"/><span t-if="errors.get('name')" id="name-error" class="field-error" t-esc="errors['name']"/></div><div class="form-field"><label for="contact-email">Email address *</label><input id="contact-email" name="email" type="email" required="required" maxlength="254" autocomplete="email" placeholder="alex@yourbusiness.com" t-att-value="form.get('email', '')" t-att-aria-invalid="'true' if errors.get('email') else None" t-att-aria-describedby="'email-error' if errors.get('email') else None"/><span t-if="errors.get('email')" id="email-error" class="field-error" t-esc="errors['email']"/></div></div>
                        <div class="form-row"><div class="form-field"><label for="contact-company">Company / organisation</label><input id="contact-company" name="company" maxlength="160" autocomplete="organization" placeholder="Your business name" t-att-value="form.get('company', '')"/><span t-if="errors.get('company')" class="field-error" t-esc="errors['company']"/></div><div class="form-field"><label for="contact-phone">Phone <span>(optional)</span></label><input id="contact-phone" name="phone" type="tel" maxlength="50" autocomplete="tel" placeholder="Your contact number" t-att-value="form.get('phone', '')"/><span t-if="errors.get('phone')" class="field-error" t-esc="errors['phone']"/></div></div>
                        <div class="form-field"><label for="contact-interest">What can we help with? *</label><select id="contact-interest" name="interest" required="required" t-att-aria-invalid="'true' if errors.get('interest') else None"><option value="" disabled="disabled" t-att-selected="not form.get('interest')">Choose an option</option><option t-foreach="interests" t-as="interest" t-att-value="interest" t-att-selected="form.get('interest') == interest" t-esc="interest"/></select><span t-if="errors.get('interest')" class="field-error" t-esc="errors['interest']"/></div>
                        <div class="form-field"><label for="contact-message">What do you have in mind? *</label><textarea id="contact-message" name="message" rows="5" required="required" maxlength="6000" placeholder="Tell us about your idea, the process you’d like to improve, or the tools you’re working with." t-att-aria-invalid="'true' if errors.get('message') else None" t-att-aria-describedby="'message-error' if errors.get('message') else None"><t t-esc="form.get('message', '')"/></textarea><span t-if="errors.get('message')" id="message-error" class="field-error" t-esc="errors['message']"/></div>
                        <div class="honeypot" aria-hidden="true"><label for="website-url">Leave this field empty</label><input id="website-url" name="website_url" type="text" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"/></div>
                        <div class="consent-row"><input id="contact-consent" type="checkbox" name="consent" value="yes" required="required" t-att-checked="consent_checked"/><label for="contact-consent">I agree that Biztinct can contact me about this enquiry. See how we handle your information in our <a href="/privacy">privacy notice</a>.</label></div><span t-if="errors.get('consent')" class="field-error" t-esc="errors['consent']"/>
                        <button class="button submit-button" type="submit">Send your enquiry <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><p class="form-note">A conversation, not a commitment.</p>
                    </form>
                </div>
            </section>
            <section class="contact-faq shell"><div><p class="eyebrow">BEFORE WE CHAT</p><h2>A few things<br/>you might <em>wonder.</em></h2></div><div class="faq-list"><details><summary>Do I need to know exactly what I want?</summary><p>No. Describe the problem or the outcome you have in mind. We can start there and explore the options together.</p></details><details><summary>Can you work with our existing processes?</summary><p>That’s where we start. We look at your existing workflows and discuss the right mix of custom development and established functionality.</p></details><details><summary>Can we start with one part of the business?</summary><p>Yes. Your enquiry can be about a specific application, a manual workflow, a website, or a wider business system.</p></details><details><summary>Do you work with not-for-profit organisations?</summary><p>Yes. Custom applications and process automation for NGOs and not-for-profits are part of what we offer.</p></details></div></section>
        </t>
    </template>

    <template id="thanks" name="Biztinct enquiry confirmation">
        <t t-call="biztinct_website.layout"><section class="shell thanks-section"><div class="thanks-mark" aria-hidden="true">✓</div><p class="eyebrow">A GOOD PLACE TO START</p><h1>You’re on our radar.<br/><em>Thank you.</em></h1><p>Your enquiry has been saved.<br/>We’ll be in touch to learn more about what you have in mind.</p><a class="button" href="/">Back to the bigger picture <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="mailto:ash@biztinct.com">Or email Ash directly <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section></t>
    </template>

    <template id="login" name="Biztinct account sign-in">
        <t t-call="biztinct_website.layout">
            <section class="shell login-section">
                <div class="login-intro"><p class="eyebrow">ACCOUNT ACCESS</p><h1>Welcome<br/><em>back.</em></h1><p>Your work. Your possibilities.<br/>All in one place.</p><a class="text-link" href="/">Back to Biztinct <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
                <div class="contact-form-wrap login-card">
                    <div class="form-heading"><h2>Let’s pick up<br/>where you <em>left off.</em></h2><p>Sign in with your Biztinct account.</p></div>
                    <form action="/web/login" method="post" class="login-form">
                        <input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" t-att-value="request.csrf_token()"/>
                        <input type="hidden" name="redirect" t-att-value="redirect or ''"/>
                        <div t-if="error" class="form-error-summary" role="alert"><t t-esc="error"/></div>
                        <div class="form-field"><label for="login">Username / email</label><input id="login" name="login" type="text" autocomplete="username" required="required" autofocus="autofocus" t-att-value="login or ''" placeholder="Your account username"/></div>
                        <div class="form-field"><label for="password">Account password</label><input id="password" name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required="required" placeholder="Your account password"/></div>
                        <button class="button submit-button" type="submit">Sign in <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
                    </form>
                    <p class="login-help">Need help with access? <a href="mailto:ash@biztinct.com">Contact Ash</a>.</p>
                </div>
            </section>
        </t>
    </template>

    <template id="privacy" name="Biztinct enquiry privacy notice">
        <t t-call="biztinct_website.layout"><section class="shell privacy-section"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR INFORMATION</p><h1>A little clarity.<br/><em>About your privacy.</em></h1><div class="prose"><h2>Information you share with us</h2><p>The contact form collects your name, email address, enquiry and chosen area of interest. Your organisation and phone number are optional. Please do not include passwords, financial account information or sensitive personal records in your enquiry.</p><h2>How we use your enquiry</h2><p>We save your enquiry in the Biztinct business system and use it to respond to your request, discuss your requirements and manage the conversation. An email notification is routed to ash@biztinct.com through Google’s mail service once outgoing mail is configured.</p><h2>Cookies and abuse prevention</h2><p>The website uses essential session cookies to support the contact form and security checks. We keep a hashed network identifier with submissions to limit automated abuse. The public pages do not include advertising trackers or third-party analytics scripts.</p><h2>Access and questions</h2><p>Access to saved enquiries is restricted to authorised administrators. To ask about your information, request a correction or ask us to remove an enquiry, contact <a href="mailto:ash@biztinct.com">ash@biztinct.com</a>.</p></div></section></t>
    </template>
</odoo>
